BBSGuard is a program which will monitor the phone ringing, monitor
carrier detect, disable Guru Meditations, auto-cancel all requesters,
and if a volume is validating, pause the system until it is done.

To run BBSGuard you just have to decide which options you want to
use (see the BBSGuard.doc file) and then put the appropriate entry
in your S:Startup-Sequence.

For quick help just enter: BBSGuard ?
